    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300305/1023003050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜は雛菜の楽しくてしあわせなことを\r\nし続けていきたいので～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300305/1023003050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……\r\nでも、それが『アイドル』なのかな～？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
