  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雛菜、会員登録してたのか\r\nこれ、月額1000円くらいするよな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nママが、自分が出てるんだからちゃんと見ろ～って！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300305/1023003050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか登録してくれた～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300305/1023003050140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……\r\nそうだったのか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、事務所の方から見られる端末、\r\n渡しておけばよかったんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～？\r\nいいよ～、ママ見させて話したいんだと思う",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300305/1023003050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "シーズン３より、\r\n１と２を見ろって言ってるし～……",
