    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……でも、このインタビューは\r\n自分のスマホにも保存しておこうかな～",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300305/1023003050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "この時の雛菜、自分にとって\r\n『夢』とか『アイドル』ってなんだろうって",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300305/1023003050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003050190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "上手く言葉にならなくて\r\nすっごくいっぱい考えてたから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
